          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 127005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Masukkan array yang berisi <code>\"Luz\"</code> ke konstanta <code>siblings</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" siblings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Luz&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(siblings)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;Luz&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"Luz\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Empty array",
            "id": 127006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menetapkan array kosong ke konstanta <code>unicorns</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" unicorns = [\" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"]()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(unicorns)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Jacob&quot;]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>[String]()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 127007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat konstanta <code>activeUsers</code> yang menyimpan array dengan nilai <code>\"Finn\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Active:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(activeUsers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Larry&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Active:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[&quot;Finn&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>activeUsers</code>, diikuti oleh <code>[</code>, lalu <code>\"Finn\"</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
