            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat array dengan <code>\"peach\"</code> lalu <code>\"bowser\"</code> sebagai dua nilai terakhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" characters = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;luigi&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peach&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bowser&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"peach\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"bowser\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
